<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Seloga shares debut at 9.0 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Seloga shares debut at 9.0 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Seloga Holdings Bhd made their market debut at 9.0 ringgit against an offer price of 2.90.</p>
<p>Around five minutes into the opening, the stock was at 9.50 with 606,000 shares traded.  </p>
<p>The investment holding company with interests in construction and property development offered for sale 2.8 million vendor shares and issued 3.4 million new shares for its listing on the Kuala Lumpur Stoxk Exchange's second board.</p>
<p>The company forecast net earnings of 14.9 million ringgit for the year ended July 31, 1997, against 9.05 million in the previous year.</p>
